{
  "content": {
    "arguments": "$ARGUMENTS",
    "constraints": [
      {
        "id": "fb09e7f8-0acc-4d84-be6d-528d3759ca5d",
        "text": "Use the Bash tool. The Pebbles CLI at \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" is the ONLY sanctioned way to change spec files — never edit .pebble files directly."
      },
      {
        "id": "c48684cd-b40c-45d1-8330-55736335e5ef",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Spec mutation contract (rules/system/spec-mutation-contract)"
      },
      {
        "id": "9c4663ea-f298-45a5-be48-bbeb376e07c9",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Status discipline (rules/system/status-discipline)"
      },
      {
        "id": "5bae344b-2c0b-4c3b-9e46-b98e10978232",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Table completeness (rules/system/table-completeness)"
      },
      {
        "id": "a9fe1072-1b50-4092-9df0-150894bc3aea",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Requirement fidelity (rules/system/requirement-fidelity)"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [],
    "kind": "skill",
    "onFailure": [
      {
        "id": "41bbd529-a051-4c01-8e9f-bd28c35881f4",
        "text": "Read the CLI error — it names the fix; correct the call and retry once"
      },
      {
        "id": "23d8d8c4-aedd-4fe3-94ab-b5d6c1351217",
        "text": "NEVER fall back to editing .pebble files directly, whatever failed"
      },
      {
        "id": "bcd0155a-0ef4-4914-9a10-82ecafd8c01c",
        "text": "If still blocked, report the exact command and error to the user and stop"
      }
    ],
    "output": "Spec, not code: items with testable descriptions, statuses starting planned.",
    "prerequisites": [
      {
        "id": "ff94c022-3d5d-472e-b1cf-61cfc1994ae7",
        "text": "The outcome and its acceptance criteria are settled — ask if genuinely ambiguous before decomposing"
      }
    ],
    "purpose": "Decompose a requirement into linked, verifiable spec",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "34c363ce-17ce-46a7-b64c-747beca55d5a",
        "text": "Plan from this requirement — produce spec, not code: $ARGUMENTS"
      },
      {
        "id": "6a78f903-ac2c-4886-8bb6-d64ba2154c93",
        "text": "SCOPE FIRST (echo before writing): the outcome being planned and its acceptance criteria as you understand them; ask if the criteria are genuinely ambiguous — a plan on the wrong target is wasted."
      },
      {
        "id": "86e3a166-22b2-4fd3-93b0-fa4542d1c0a0",
        "text": "STEP 1 — DECOMPOSE into concrete, independently VERIFIABLE pieces — each a checklist item with a testable description (\"given X, when Y, then Z\"), never a vague task. Untestable items are the failure mode."
      },
      {
        "id": "94d1dae4-6010-4864-a8fa-489ac6e7a68b",
        "text": "STEP 2 — MODEL what the work needs: where warranted create the linked pebbles (a workflow for a process, the models/structures/apis it touches) via the CLI, and connect them with refs so the plan is a graph, not a flat list. Reference what exists; note what must be created first."
      },
      {
        "id": "4dffb432-74e3-4b0f-9a77-b9a868ea0b35",
        "text": "STEP 3 — WRITE: add-item the checklist entries and create the linked pebbles; every piece starts status planned. Do NOT write application code — this skill produces the spec that implementation will follow."
      },
      {
        "id": "e48b4770-b27a-48cb-90a9-226727b7324d",
        "text": "Report: the decomposition with each piece's acceptance criterion and how the pieces connect (refs)."
      }
    ],
    "verify": [
      {
        "id": "e8bd4b99-ae9d-42f7-a9d4-00e2a67f1e25",
        "text": "Every piece has a testable description; statuses start planned; refs connect the pieces"
      }
    ],
    "whenToUse": "Decomposing a requirement into verifiable pieces — checklist items and linked pebbles — before any code is written."
  },
  "createdAt": "2026-07-21T14:32:38.770Z",
  "description": "Decompose a requirement into linked, verifiable spec",
